==Battleground==
*3 [[Those Guys]] (100%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*6 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] (4,000%) spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Loris]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*5 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] at a good level can solo Casaurian Ahirujo, and if you kill it fast enough, Courier will be able to continue unimpeded so beat down the rest of the stage. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] is helpful once Ahirujo falls, or you can try to use him on Ahirujo, though this may be a bit risky.

